Campfire for BEAM: a wallet database that fails to open is closed again.

WalletDB's OpenAndMigrateIfNeeded() opens the sqlite connection, keys it and test-reads
it; when the password is wrong (or the file is not a wallet) it throws and leaves the
connection open. WalletDB::isValidPassword() never closes its check connection, even on
success, and WalletDB::open() keeps the main connection when the private one fails.

A wallet-api process exits after such a failure, so stock builds never notice. Inside
the app (the in-process core: libbeam_core, the iOS library) every wrong password
attempt kept its connection for the life of the process: measured with leaks(1) on
macOS, 241 KB per attempt (sqlite lookaside 128 KB + page cache 96 KB + the rest).

Found while verifying libbeam_core; library series for now, a core-series candidate
(iOS's in-process core has the same leak). Behaviour is otherwise unchanged. Applied
after 0204. patch -p1.

--- a/wallet/core/wallet_db.cpp
+++ b/wallet/core/wallet_db.cpp
@@ -1226,6 +1226,7 @@
         {
             sqlite3* db = nullptr;
             OpenAndMigrateIfNeeded(path, &db, password);
+            sqlite3_close(db); // Campfire (patch 0205): only a check; do not keep it open
             return true;
         }
         catch (...)
@@ -1800,6 +1801,12 @@
 
         void OpenAndMigrateIfNeeded(const string& path, sqlite3** db, const SecString& password)
         {
+            // Campfire (patch 0205): a database that does not open (wrong password, ...) is
+            // closed before the exception leaves. In a process that keeps running (the
+            // in-process core) every failed attempt would otherwise keep its sqlite
+            // connection, about 240 KB, for good.
+            try
+            {
             int ret = sqlite3_open_v2(path.c_str(), db, SQLITE_OPEN_READWRITE, nullptr);
             throwIfError(ret, *db);
             enterKey(*db, password);
@@ -1819,6 +1826,16 @@
                 ret = checkKey();
                 throwIfError(ret, *db);
             }
+            }
+            catch (...)
+            {
+                if (*db)
+                {
+                    sqlite3_close(*db);
+                    *db = nullptr;
+                }
+                throw;
+            }
         }
 
         bool MoveSeedToPrivateVariables(WalletDB& db)
@@ -2234,7 +2251,15 @@
         bool separateDBForPrivateData = isInitialized(privatePath);
         if (separateDBForPrivateData)
         {
-            OpenAndMigrateIfNeeded(privatePath, &sdb, password);
+            try
+            {
+                OpenAndMigrateIfNeeded(privatePath, &sdb, password);
+            }
+            catch (...)
+            {
+                sqlite3_close(db); // Campfire (patch 0205): the main database too
+                throw;
+            }
         }
 
         auto walletDB = make_shared<WalletDB>(db, sdb);
